@startuml
title Context Diagram - Cardiopulmonary Sound Separation Prototype

left to right direction
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #2F4858
  BackgroundColor #F8FBFC
}
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor "Student / Researcher User" as User
database "Public Audio Datasets\n(for development and evaluation)" as Dataset
rectangle "Cardiopulmonary Sound\nSeparation Prototype" as System

User --> System : Upload mixed\ncardiopulmonary audio
System --> User : Validation feedback\nand processing status
System --> User : Separated heart\nsound output
System --> User : Separated lung\nsound output
Dataset --> System : Training or evaluation\nrecordings

note bottom of System
Prototype scope: sound separation only.
No disease diagnosis or treatment decision is provided.
end note

@enduml
